    "title": "Waiting Without Losing Heart | A Brief Christian Reflection & Quiet Worship Piano",
    "thumbnail_text": "WAIT WITH COURAGE",
    "full_text": "Waiting is not proof that you have been forgotten. But I don’t think faith asks us to pretend that uncertainty is easy. There is a difference between taking the next responsible step and trying to control every outcome. Tonight, name one thing you can do tomorrow. Write it down. Then give yourself permission to stop rehearsing everything you cannot solve right now. Courage can be quiet. Rest can be part of faithfulness. As this piano continues, you can pray in your own words or simply listen. You do not have to manufacture a feeling to be welcome here.",
